  <name>TPC2 Next</name>
  <summary>Upload, download and remote-control a Doctor V64</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      TPC2 Next is a modern replacement for Bung's TPC2.EXE upload/download
      tool and V64IO2.EXE remote-control utility for the Doctor V64.
    </p>
    <p>
      It supports the Pico USB bridge, legacy parallel-port connections and a
      built-in demo device. The GUI and CLI can upload and download files,
      read and write V64 memory, call 6502 routines and print text on the V64
      on-screen display.
    </p>
  </description>
